[Mission.Objectives]
Stop the breakthrough
[Mission.Success]
The enemy couldn't break through the pass!
[Mission.Failed]
Retreat! The enemy has broken through the pass!
[Mission.Description]
Stop the breakthrough of the German groups through the Kasserine Pass
[Submission1.Objectives]
Blunt enemy attacks along possible breach axes.
[Submission1.Description]
Lieutenant Colonel Waters! You must prevent the German troops from breaking through the Kasserine pass.
[Submission1.Success]
The order has been carried out! The enemy is retreating!
[Submission1.Failed]
Our troops have failed! The enemy continues to advance!
[Submission2.Success]
British tanks have arrived!
[Submission2.Description]
Hold until British tanks arrive
[Submission2.Objectives]
Hold on
[Submission2.Failed]
We have failed! The reinforcements had no time to arrive!
[Submission3.Objectives]
Find and destroy enemy fire spotters
[Submission3.Description]
A mortar battery is firing at positions of the 1st Infantry Division. Locate and eliminate the enemy artillery spotters.
[Submission3.Success]
Enemy spotters have been eliminated!
[Submission3.Failed]
Enemy spotters have not been eliminated!